Package: DSEMr
Title: Dynamic Structural Equation Models
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Marcus", "Harris", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "160916588+MarcusHarrisUConn@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Provides a clean-room framework for specifying, simulating, and
    estimating dynamic structural equation models. Models can be expressed
    with an extension of 'lavaan' syntax or a documented subset of Mplus-like
    syntax and are compiled to a common intermediate representation. The
    initial experimental estimator implements Bayesian Gaussian autoregressive
    models and a Rust numerical kernel, with reproducible process-level
    parallelism for chains and Monte Carlo studies. Broader model families are
    represented by the compiler but are rejected by the estimator until their
    validation gates are complete.
